WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.371 --> 00:00:11.370
1. Your business account
Sign in and open “For businesses”

2
00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:19.370
2. Details, photo and services
Add your business details. Preview your photo before saving it

3
00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:27.371
3. Team and working hours
Add professionals and their working hours before submitting your business for review

4
00:00:27.371 --> 00:00:35.379
4. Your whole day in the calendar
Orange: Eneres bookings. Blue: manual entries. Select a free time to add an appointment

5
00:00:35.379 --> 00:00:44.379
5. Add a manual appointment
Required: client name, phone, service, price, professional, date and time

6
00:00:44.379 --> 00:00:52.378
6. A new Eneres booking
Online bookings enter your calendar automatically and appear in notifications

7
00:00:52.378 --> 00:01:01.379
7. Customer mobile and “Booking noted”
Open the customer’s details and notes, then mark the booking as noted

8
00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:09.388
8. Cancellation reason and history
Cancellation is recorded and frees the time. The customer can see the reason
